## Causes
- unreadable-package-root.test.ts (2), app-config.test.ts 'read-only' (1), agent-package-folder-watcher.test.ts 'reports UNAVAILABLE…' (1): they make a folder/file unreadable or read-only with chmod; this container runs as root, which ignores those permissions (e.g. expected ['alpha'] but got ['alpha','ext'] — the chmod 0o000 package was read). Same on base source.
- agent-package-folder-watcher.test.ts other 4 ('Timed out waiting for the monitor'): same on base source; not pinned down (folder watching in this container).
- socratic-live-tutor-renderer.test.ts, socratic-runtime-lifecycle.test.ts: the files fail to load, 'Error: No such built-in module: node:'; same on base source.
- Each fails identically with base source (the section above), so this change does not cause them.
